# eBay Product Hunter Agent - API keys (ALL OPTIONAL: hunts run through the signed-in Chrome browser without any key)
# 1. Paste each value after the = sign in the file named .env, then save. No quotes, no spaces.
# 2. Never paste a key into chat, a CSV, the workbook or the review page.
# 3. Do NOT put website passwords, card details or 2FA codes here.
# 4. .env is in .gitignore. .env.example is the blank copy that may be shared.
# Check with: powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File tools\env_check.ps1   (shows SET or EMPTY only)

# --- 1. eBay developer keys, PRODUCTION keyset (developer.ebay.com). Research only: never add a user token that can list or edit.
EBAY_CLIENT_ID=
EBAY_CLIENT_SECRET=
EBAY_MARKETPLACE_ID=EBAY_GB

# --- 2. AW Dropship (aw-dropship.com: Channels > your Manual/API channel > API > API tokens). TICK "Read only" when generating it.
AW_DROPSHIP_API_TOKEN=

# --- 3. AliExpress Open Platform (openservice.aliexpress.com). Leave empty until approved.
ALIEXPRESS_APP_KEY=
ALIEXPRESS_APP_SECRET=